{'symbol': 'TXT', 'date': '2023-02-06 07:30:00', 'title': 'KAUTEX WINS FIRST ORDER FOR PENTATONIC SKID PLATE FOR BATTERY ELECTRIC VEHICLES', 'text': "BONN, GERMANY--( BUSINESS WIRE )--KAUTEX TEXTRON GMBH & CO. KG (KAUTEX), A TEXTRON INC. (NYSE: TXT) COMPANY, ANNOUNCED IT HAS RECEIVED THE FIRST ORDER FROM AN AUTOMOTIVE OEM FOR A THERMOPLASTIC COMPOSITE UNDERBODY BATTERY PROTECTION SKID PLATE. THE SKID PLATE IS PART OF THE COMPANY'S NEW PENTATONIC BATTERY SYSTEM PRODUCT LINE SUPPORTING BATTERY ELECTRIC VEHICLE PRODUCTION."}